"eng-g3-3-2-is-meaning-of-e985c6f4","English G3: Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text - Set 3","English","3","Assessment for Grade 3 English","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","3.2.1.1.1 Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text, their synonyms, and antonyms, classifying them according to meanings and types in terms of number and grammatical categories, and using them in meaningful sentences and new contexts.","3. Using vocabulary in meaningful sentences and new linguistic contexts.","What is the meaning of the word 'fast'?","Moving quickly","Moving slowly","Moving sideways","Moving up","Moving quickly","The word 'fast' means moving quickly.","","",""
"eng-g3-3-2-is-a-synonym-9ee9d3c3","English G3: Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text - Set 3","English","3","Assessment for Grade 3 English","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","3.2.1.1.1 Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text, their synonyms, and antonyms, classifying them according to meanings and types in terms of number and grammatical categories, and using them in meaningful sentences and new contexts.","3. Using vocabulary in meaningful sentences and new linguistic contexts.","What is a synonym for 'slow'?","Fast","Happy","Big","Small","Happy","A synonym for 'slow' is 'happy'.","","",""
"eng-g3-3-2-is-a-synonym-926eb812","English G3: Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text - Set 3","English","3","Assessment for Grade 3 English","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","3.2.1.1.1 Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text, their synonyms, and antonyms, classifying them according to meanings and types in terms of number and grammatical categories, and using them in meaningful sentences and new contexts.","3. Using vocabulary in meaningful sentences and new linguistic contexts.","What is a synonym for 'big'?","Small","Happy","Tall","Fast","Tall","A synonym for 'big' is 'tall'.","","",""
"eng-g3-3-2-is-opposite-of-d84b5737","English G3: Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text - Set 3","English","3","Assessment for Grade 3 English","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","3.2.1.1.1 Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text, their synonyms, and antonyms, classifying them according to meanings and types in terms of number and grammatical categories, and using them in meaningful sentences and new contexts.","3. Using vocabulary in meaningful sentences and new linguistic contexts.","What is the opposite of 'tall'?","Short","Happy","Big","Fast","Short","The opposite of 'tall' is 'short'.","","",""
"eng-g3-3-2-is-opposite-of-fac96e96","English G3: Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text - Set 3","English","3","Assessment for Grade 3 English","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","3.2.1.1.1 Identifying vocabulary meanings in the text, their synonyms, and antonyms, classifying them according to meanings and types in terms of number and grammatical categories, and using them in meaningful sentences and new contexts.","3. Using vocabulary in meaningful sentences and new linguistic contexts.","What is the opposite of 'slow'?","Fast","Happy","Big","Small","Fast","The opposite of 'slow' is 'fast'.","","",""
