"math-g3-3-4-2-1-1-is-purpose-of-bdb9082e","Math G3: Collecting and organizing data from the environment - Set 2","Math","3","Assessment for Grade 3 Math","true","2026-07-12T12:10:52.824Z","3-4-4-1-1 Collecting and organizing data from the environment, representing and reading them using bar graphs and symbols, and interpreting them.","2. Representing data with vertical and horizontal bar graphs, symbols.","What is the purpose of using symbols in a graph?","To make the graph look pretty","To show the title of the graph","To represent data in a simple way","To label the axes","To represent data in a simple way","Symbols are used to represent data in a simple way, making it easier to understand the information.","","",""
"math-g3-3-4-2-1-1-how-can-a-0cccae2f","Math G3: Collecting and organizing data from the environment - Set 2","Math","3","Assessment for Grade 3 Math","true","2026-07-12T12:10:52.824Z","3-4-4-1-1 Collecting and organizing data from the environment, representing and reading them using bar graphs and symbols, and interpreting them.","2. Representing data with vertical and horizontal bar graphs, symbols.","How can a symbol be used in a graph?","To label the axes","To show the title","To represent a category of data","To make the graph look pretty","To represent a category of data","A symbol can be used in a graph to represent a category of data, making it easier to understand and compare the information being presented.","","",""
"math-g3-3-4-2-1-1-is-purpose-of-d6e4951a","Math G3: Collecting and organizing data from the environment - Set 2","Math","3","Assessment for Grade 3 Math","true","2026-07-12T12:10:52.824Z","3-4-4-1-1 Collecting and organizing data from the environment, representing and reading them using bar graphs and symbols, and interpreting them.","2. Representing data with vertical and horizontal bar graphs, symbols.","What is the purpose of collecting and organizing data?","To make a pretty graph","To show how many of something there are","To understand and learn from the information","To count the number of things","To understand and learn from the information","Collecting and organizing data is done to understand and learn from the information, making it possible to make informed decisions or draw conclusions.","","",""
