"math-g9-9-4-2-1-1-is-value-of-4e4b2a14","Math G9: Performing the four operations on integers - Set 1 T1","Math","9","Assessment for Grade 9 Math","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","9-4-2-2-1 Writing algebraic expressions with rational coefficients, finding their values, performing arithmetic operations on them, and Distinguishing basic identities.","3. Distinguishing the basic identities: the square of a sum of two terms, the square of a difference of two terms, and the product of the sum and difference of two terms, and using them.","What is the value of 9 - 4?","5","The difference of 9 and 4","The sum of 9 and 4","The product of 9 and 4","5","Subtraction is the inverse operation of addition.","","",""
