"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-effect-of-a21d37e9","Science G6: Classifying the layers of the atmosphere and identifying - Set 4","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-1Classifying the layers of the atmosphere and identifying their components, characteristics, changes, its effects on the environment and their benefits to humans.","4. Explaining the causes of climate change in some regions of the world and proposing multiple solutions to address the impacts and risks of weather fluctuations.","What is the effect of climate change on the environment?","Climate change has no effect on the environment.","Climate change causes the Earth's temperature to decrease.","Climate change causes the Earth's temperature to increase, leading to rising sea levels, more frequent natural disasters, and loss of biodiversity.","Climate change causes the Earth's rotation speed to increase.","Climate change causes the Earth's temperature to increase, leading to rising sea levels, more frequent natural disasters, and loss of biodiversity.","Climate change causes the Earth's temperature to increase, leading to rising sea levels, more frequent natural disasters, and loss of biodiversity.","","",""
"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-main-cause-4279585f","Science G6: Classifying the layers of the atmosphere and identifying - Set 4","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-1Classifying the layers of the atmosphere and identifying their components, characteristics, changes, its effects on the environment and their benefits to humans.","4. Explaining the causes of climate change in some regions of the world and proposing multiple solutions to address the impacts and risks of weather fluctuations.","What is the main cause of climate change in some regions of the world?","The main cause of climate change is the increase in the Earth's distance from the sun.","The main cause of climate change is the decrease in the Earth's distance from the sun.","The main cause of climate change is the burning of fossil fuels and deforestation.","The main cause of climate change is the increase in the Earth's rotation speed.","The main cause of climate change is the burning of fossil fuels and deforestation.","The main cause of climate change is the burning of fossil fuels and deforestation, which releases greenhouse gases such as carbon dioxide and methane into the atmosphere, leading to global warming.","","",""
