"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-process-called-386b69b8","Science G6: Deducing the relationship of the Earth's - Set 3","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-2 Deducing the relationship of the Earth›s spheres to each other and predicting the interactions, and changes that occur between them and the geological effects resulting from them.","1. Describing the Earth's spheres and Plate tectonics, identifying the layers of the Earth that make up the lithosphere and the biosphere, and distinguishing between them.","What is the process called when the Earth's crust is broken and magma rises to the surface?","Continental drift","Plate tectonics","Seafloor spreading","Volcanic eruption","Volcanic eruption","A volcanic eruption is the process when the Earth's crust is broken and magma rises to the surface, which is a result of the movement of magma.","","",""
