"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-term-movement-ef6f428a","Science G6: Deducing the relationship of the Earth's spheres to each - Set 3","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-2 Deducing the relationship of the Earth›s spheres to each other and predicting the interactions, and changes that occur between them and the geological effects resulting from them.","1. Describing the Earth's spheres and Plate tectonics, identifying the layers of the Earth that make up the lithosphere and the biosphere, and distinguishing between them.","What is the term for the movement of the Earth's crust that creates mountains and volcanoes?","Plate tectonics","Weathering and erosion","Glaciation","Earthquakes","Plate tectonics","Plate tectonics is the term for the movement of the Earth's crust that creates mountains and volcanoes.","","",""
