"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-result-of-a89dbb19","Science G6: Describing the factors and processes that affected the Earth's - Set 2","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-3 Describing the factors and processes that affected the Earth›s surface which changed some of its","1. Distinguishing mineral and its properties and describing its relationship to rocks, and how they are formed.","What is the result of a volcanic eruption?","New land is formed","The Earth's surface becomes smoother","Volcanic ash and lava are released","The Earth's temperature increases","Volcanic ash and lava are released","Volcanic eruptions release volcanic ash and lava, which can affect the surrounding environment.","","",""
