"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-process-called-9062b096","Science G6: Describing the factors and processes that - Set 1","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-3 Describing the factors and processes that affected the Earth›s surface which changed some of its","3. Explaining the factors of erosion, weathering, and sedimentation and their causes, and predicting the patterns of their action and their effects on earth.","What is the process called when wind and water wear away rocks and soil?","Weathering is the process of rocks changing into soil","Erosion is the process of rocks changing into soil","Weathering is the process of wind and water wearing away rocks and soil","Erosion is the process of wind and water wearing away rocks and soil","Weathering is the process of wind and water wearing away rocks and soil","Weathering is the process of wind and water wearing away rocks and soil, breaking them down into smaller pieces.","","",""
