"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-main-reason-67ab80ee","Science G6: Determining the causes and effects of - Set 1","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-1Classifying the layers of the atmosphere and identifying their components, characteristics, changes, its effects on the environment and their benefits to humans.","2. Explaining the movement of air masses and air currents and describing their effects on Earth’s weather.","What is the main reason why the Earth's surface is broken into several large plates?","Weather changes","Tectonic plate movement","Human activities","Volcanic eruptions","Tectonic plate movement","Tectonic plate movement is the main reason why the Earth's surface is broken into several large plates.","","",""
"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-term-movement-8f61ede5","Science G6: Determining the causes and effects of - Set 1","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-3 Describing the factors and processes that affected the Earth›s surface which changed some of its","3. Explaining the factors of erosion, weathering, and sedimentation and their causes, and predicting the patterns of their action and their effects on earth.","What is the term for the movement of the Earth's crust that can cause the creation of mountains?","Weathering","Erosion","Plate Tectonics","Glaciation","Plate Tectonics","Plate Tectonics is the movement of the Earth's crust that can cause the creation of mountains.","","",""
