"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-process-called-367be59a","Science G6: Determining the causes and effects of - Set 2","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-3-2-3 Describing the factors and processes that affected the Earth›s surface which changed some of its","3. Explaining the factors of erosion, weathering, and sedimentation and their causes, and predicting the patterns of their action and their effects on earth.","What is the process called when magma from the Earth's interior rises to the surface?","Weathering","Erosion","Plate Tectonics","Volcanic Eruption","Volcanic Eruption","A volcanic eruption occurs when magma from the Earth's interior rises to the surface, releasing hot ash, gas, and rock.","","",""
