"sci-g6-6-5-1-2-1-is-effect-of-669bdf19","Science G6: Inferring the impact of human activity - Set 2","Science","6","Assessment for Grade 6 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","6-5-1-3-5 Inferring the impact of human activity on environmental habitats and populations, and predicting its effect, proposing solutions for their protection","1. Explaining human interaction with environments, and inferring the positive and negative impact of human activities on the environmental habitats and populations.","What is the effect of the Najd Mountains on the local water supply?","It increases the amount of rainfall","It has no effect on the water supply","It decreases the amount of rainfall","It provides a source of fresh water","It provides a source of fresh water","The Najd Mountains provide a source of fresh water, as they create a rain shadow effect that leads to more rainfall on the western side of the mountains.","","",""
