"sci-g9-9-5-3-1-1-is-difference-biomass-474006c2","Science G9: Describing the concept of biomass and - Set 1","Science","9","Assessment for Grade 9 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","9-5-3-3-2 Determining the sources of natural resources, ways of managing them, and the importance of preserving and developing them.","2. Predicting the effects and variables when relying entirely on non-renewable energy sources.","What is the difference between biomass and fossil fuels?","Biomass is a non-renewable energy source, while fossil fuels are renewable","Biomass is a renewable energy source, while fossil fuels are non-renewable","Biomass and fossil fuels are the same thing","Biomass is a type of fossil fuel","Biomass is a renewable energy source, while fossil fuels are non-renewable","Biomass is a renewable energy source, while fossil fuels are non-renewable.","","",""
