"sci-g9-9-5-3-1-1-is-punnett-square-d11857f2","Science G9: Describing the development of genetics, and - Set 4","Science","9","Assessment for Grade 9 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","9-5-1-4-1 Describing the development of genetics, and the use of Mendelian laws to explain the inheritance of genetic traits, and the probabilities of their appearance in different generations.","5. Calculating the probability of the appearance of genetic characteristics of living organisms using the Punnett square.","What is the Punnett square used for in genetics?","To predict the probability of genetic traits in offspring","To determine the genetic makeup of an organism","To identify the different types of genetic inheritance","To calculate the probability of genetic mutations","To predict the probability of genetic traits in offspring","The Punnett square is a tool used to predict the probability of genetic traits in offspring by showing all possible combinations of alleles.","","",""
