"sci-g9-9-5-3-1-1-of-is-a-9c719e3b","Science G9: Describing the types of rocks and minerals - Set 2","Science","9","Assessment for Grade 9 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","9-5-3-2-4 Describing the types of rocks and minerals, their characteristics and","1. Determining the general and specific characteristics of rocks and minerals, and indicating their uses in his area.","Which of the following is a characteristic of a mineral's crystal structure?","It is a naturally occurring solid mass of mineral material.","It is a naturally occurring inorganic solid with a specific chemical composition.","It is a repeating pattern of atoms.","It is a type of rock formation.","It is a repeating pattern of atoms.","A mineral's crystal structure is a repeating pattern of atoms that is unique to that mineral.","","",""
