"sci-g9-9-5-3-1-1-of-is-a-c16307fa","Science G9: Describing the types of rocks and minerals - Set 2","Science","9","Assessment for Grade 9 Science","false","2027-01-05T21:00:00.000Z","9-5-3-2-4 Describing the types of rocks and minerals, their characteristics and","1. Determining the general and specific characteristics of rocks and minerals, and indicating their uses in his area.","Which of the following is a characteristic of a rock?","It is a naturally occurring inorganic solid with a specific chemical composition.","It is a naturally occurring solid mass of mineral material.","It is formed by human activity.","It is a naturally occurring solid with a specific crystal structure.","It is a naturally occurring solid mass of mineral material.","Rocks are composed of one or more minerals and have a specific texture and composition.","/image-source/sci-g9-9-5-3-1-1-of-is-a-c16307fa.png","",""
